            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you're deciding whether to buy used reefer trailers, the question isn't just about price. It's about performance, reliability, scalability, and making a smart investment that supports your operation today and tomorrow. For owner-operators and growing fleets across Florida, used refrigerated trailers offer a practical way to expand capacity without overextending capital.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we work with customers every day who want dependable used equipment, transparent guidance, and access to real specifications, not guesswork. Here's why buying used reefer trailers continues to be a smart move and what to look for before you commit.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-used",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why More Fleets Are Choosing to Buy Used Reefer Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-used"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-used-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Reefer trailers are one of the most valuable assets in temperature-controlled freight. They're also one of the most expensive when purchased new. That's why many fleets are turning to used options that still deliver performance without the full new-trailer price tag.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-used-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buying used allows you to:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-used-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "dot",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce upfront costs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Preserve cash flow"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Expand capacity faster"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintain flexibility as contracts evolve"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-used-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For Florida-based operations hauling food, pharmaceuticals, or perishables, this flexibility matters.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/cost-effective-solutions-why-fleets-buy-used-reefer-trailers/1.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 854,
                      "alt": "Close-up of a Hyundai Translead ThermoTech reefer unit label on a trailer wall"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-to-look-for",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What to Look for in Used Reefer Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-to-look-for"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all used reefer trailers are equal. Knowing what to evaluate helps protect your investment and ensures reliable service.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-what-to-look-for-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Refrigeration Unit Performance",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "The reefer unit is the heart of the trailer. Review service records, operating hours, and temperature consistency."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Insulation & Structural Integrity",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Check wall panels, flooring, doors, and seals. Proper insulation is essential for maintaining temperature and fuel efficiency, especially in Florida's heat."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Availability of Specifications",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Access to accurate specs helps you match the trailer to your freight needs. That's why Sun State Trailers makes trailer specifications easy to review before you buy."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-tampa-market",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Used Reefer Trailers Tampa: A Strategic Market Advantage",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "tampa-market"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-tampa-market-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida is a major hub for temperature-controlled freight, making used reefer trailers in Tampa a high-demand search for a reason. With consistent shipping volume and regional distribution routes, used reefer trailers in this market often cycle through fleets that upgrade regularly, creating opportunities to purchase well-maintained equipment.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-tampa-market-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State Trailers serves customers across Tampa and beyond, offering inventory that's ready to work and supported by a team that understands regional demands.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-tampa-market-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
                        "label": "Explore Inventory",
                        "style": "primary"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
                        "label": "Download Trailer Specifications",
                        "style": "secondary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Reefer Trailer Financing Makes Growth More Accessible",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even with used equipment, smart financing can make a meaningful difference. Reefer trailer financing allows fleets to spread costs over time while keeping capital available for fuel, labor, and maintenance. Businesses that leverage financing strategically often scale more efficiently than those relying solely on cash purchases. Financing used reefer trailers can:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-financing-2",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Improve cash flow management"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Support fleet expansion without delay"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Align payments with revenue cycles"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financing-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State Trailers helps customers explore financing options that make sense for their operation, not one-size-fits-all solutions.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/cost-effective-solutions-why-fleets-buy-used-reefer-trailers/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 854,
                      "alt": "Row of used Hyundai Translead reefer trailers parked at a Sun State Trailers lot"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-resale-value",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding Reefer Resale Value",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "resale-value"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Another reason fleets choose used equipment is reefer resale value. Refrigerated trailers tend to hold value better than many other trailer types due to ongoing demand and durable construction.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When purchased from a trusted dealer and maintained properly, a used reefer trailer can:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-resale-value-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Deliver strong ROI"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Be resold or traded later"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Serve as a scalable asset rather than a sunk cost"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This long-term value makes used reefer trailers especially appealing for owner-operators planning gradual growth.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-sunstate",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Sun State Trailers Is a Trusted Source for Used Reefer Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-sunstate"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State Trailers, we believe buying used shouldn't feel uncertain or rushed. Our approach is built on transparency, straightforward communication, and long-term relationships.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Customers choose us because we offer:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-why-sunstate-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Carefully selected used reefer inventory"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Clear access to trailer specifications"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Honest guidance from experienced professionals"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A dealership culture rooted in dependability and service"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our team understands that your trailer isn't just equipment; it's part of how you provide for your family and your business. That mindset guides how we do business every day.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're ready to buy used reefer trailers, the right partner makes all the difference. With the right inspection process, financing options, and access to detailed specs, used reefer trailers can deliver the performance you need at a cost that supports sustainable growth.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
